  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 208.01 Applicability. This part, as well as Tax 201, shall apply to RSA 71-B:16 orders for reassessment and RSA 79-A:12 or RSA 75:16 orders for reclassification.\n\nSource. #4684, eff 10-19-89; ss by #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
